<title>JAPAN: Nissho Iwai Leasing -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissho Iwai Leasing -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.40		vs	   13.88</p>
<p> Operating	  209    million	  vs	  298    million</p>
<p> Current	    119    million	  vs	   93    million</p>
<p> Net		   41    million	  vs	   37    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.22 yen	  vs	    1.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissho Iwai Steel Leasing Co Ltd leases scaffolding for construction use.</p>
</text>
